{"id":"630250","name":"肉饼","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/630250/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"肉馅","amount":"300g"},{"name":"蛋清","amount":"1个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黑胡椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加盐加水。","img":"images/630250/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉成面团，表面抹油静置八小时。","img":"images/630250/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜切沫。","img":"images/630250/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱切碎。","img":"images/630250/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"肉馅加酱油、老抽、料酒、盐、姜沫、蛋清、鸡精、蚝油拌匀。","img":"images/630250/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加胡椒碎拌匀备用。","img":"images/630250/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团静置八小时后非常有延展性。很容易擀成大片薄饼。","img":"images/630250/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把洋葱加入拌好的肉馅均匀涂抹在面皮上。再切上四刀（如图）。切的时候注意间距一头宽，一头窄。这样一会卷起来的时候不会漏馅。","img":"images/630250/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"边缘刷水。","img":"images/630250/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将九宫格慢慢卷起。","img":"images/630250/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"每一步都把边缘封好，避免漏馅。","img":"images/630250/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"就像叠被子。","img":"images/630250/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"层层叠叠。","img":"images/630250/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"锅热倒油，中火煎得两面金黄。淋凉水盖盖子焖五分钟。","img":"images/630250/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/630250/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/630250/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"配一碗小米粥。","img":"images/630250/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"一起吃肉饼吧！","img":"images/630250/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}